#, kde-format
msgid "&Location of Regions"
msgstr "موقعیت منطقه‌ها"

#: kgeography.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In this challenge you are given a division name on the left under the menu "
"and you must find it on the map and click on it"
